167 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (data.org is a platform for partnerships to build the field of data for social impact \(DSI\). Launched in 2020 by the Mastercard Center for Inclusive Growth and The Rockefeller Foundation. data.org bring together philanthropy, private sector technology, academia, and social impact organizations to build the field of data for social impact. The oganization do this work in three ways:)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
