/T ("The Post Graduate Diploma in Data Science at IIIT Delhi, offered in collaboration with Data.org, J-PAL, and ArtPark, is a groundbreaking program in India. It trains data scientists to tackle complex issues in health, climate change, and social impact through a unique multidisciplinary curriculum and hands-on approach, setting a new standard for data science education.")
