321 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Tarini Shankar Ghosh is a computational biologist focusing on human microbiome research. He received his B.Tech from Indian Institute of Technology \(IIT\) Kharagpur, his M.Tech from IIT Kanpur and his Ph.D from the University of Hyderabad \(while working at the TCS Research of Tata Consultancy Services Ltd\). He completed his post-doctoral training from APC Microbiome Ireland. His research interests include microbiome informatics, integrated multi-OMICs, machine learning and statistical learning.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
